# The source of an ability's damage is the object that has the ability (CR 113.7); once that object has left the
# battlefield, the ability uses its last-known information (CR 113.7a, 608.2h), its controller then included. Phlage, Titan
# of Fire's Fury, cast from hand, is sacrificed by its own enters trigger, put on the stack last, before its other one
# resolves: the 3 damage that one deals is from Phlage as it last existed on the battlefield, under Bot1's control - "a
# source you control" for Bot1's Tomik, Izzet Sparkmage, which adds 1: Bot2 goes to 16.

